Rationale: Volume velocity bounds and the normalized shutter reference must agree or moving density can be clipped; defaults retain other adapters' conventions.
Contract: Carry the native volume's actual normalized shutter reference and conservative velocity envelope through volume meshing and shading. Preserve upstream defaults for other adapters.
Tests: tests/houdini_volume_motion_smoke.py, scripts/verify-upstream-patches.py

diff --git a/src/kernel/integrator/volume_shader.h b/src/kernel/integrator/volume_shader.h
